      en: ["The ESRF synchrotron in Grenoble is the world's brightest X-ray source.", "The Isère River flows directly through the northern part of the city.", "Saint-Égrève is a major residential and commercial hub in the north.", "The Chartreuse mountain range begins just north of the city limits.", "The Grenoble-Bastille cable car was first opened in 1934.", "Tramway Line E provides a fast connection from the north to the center."],
