      en: ["Victor Hugo, the famous writer, was born in Besançon in 1802.", "The Planoise district in Besançon-Ouest was built starting in 1962 as a major modern housing project.", "The Vauban Citadel was added to the UNESCO World Heritage list in 2008.", "Besançon has been regarded as the center of the French watchmaking industry since the 18th century.", "The University Hospital in Besançon-Ouest is one of the region's largest employers.", "The Doubs river flows around the historical center in an almost complete loop."],
      es: ["Sede del centro tecnológico 'Temis'", "Alberga el campus principal de la Universidad de Franco Condado", "Lugar importante para la microtecnología y la industria de precisión", "Acceso al bosque municipal 'Forêt de Chailluz'", "La autopista A36 conecta el barrio con la red de larga distancia", "La altitud varía entre los 250 y 400 metros"],
      pt: ["Sede do centro tecnológico 'Temis'", "Abriga o campus principal da Universidade de Franche-Comté", "Local importante para a microtecnologia e indústria de precisão", "Acesso à floresta municipal 'Forêt de Chailluz'", "A autoestrada A36 liga o bairro à rede de longa distância", "A altitude varia entre 250 e 400 metros"],
